Suggested commit message (apply with `git apply`, then commit with this message):

    Fix BUG-014: only auto-download Favorite on rating transition, not every panel save

    savePanelRating() re-triggered downloadWork() on ANY metadata edit
    (tags, comment) of an already-Favorite work, because the predicate
    checked the current rating level (rating == SAVE) instead of the
    transition into it. Guard on the pre-save rating (existing.rating,
    read before the upsert) so the download only fires when the work
    actually becomes Favorite for the first time.

